  "job_C1_20251003_115123": {
    "text": "O clerice, ne dempseris umquam dipticas lateri Eala \u00f0u cleric ne wana \u00f0u \u00e6fre wexbreda fram sidan.\nFugeas fore corcula labentis ludi, ne letetur te fedus sandapila neque toparchia forfleoh wesan ealdor\nSit machia tibi, quo sit ierarchia, neque sit cloaca tibi gewin \u00fe\u00e6t sy halig ealdor ne ne sy helle pyt.\nNon sit enteca nec alogia, uerum commoueat absida acrimonia mentes tecum, quia non mordet ne sy\nFiat mens tui tuus agonitheta ambasilla, ne legat cromam praeter uranium, quia solet is esse deus\nSectare gemellam anodiam fyli \u00f0u getwinne l\u00e6cedom.\nVerere sistere sicophanta, adsis tamen boba, ne tangat griffia, charchesia togaque crebro ondr\u00e6d\nSistat frequens sintheca grammaton tibi; absistat uero glaucoma, offa criminis, longe, blataque\nExistat amphitappa laon nec non badanola, diamant effipiam, stragulam pariterque propomam\nEst effipia, stragula, pretexta aulica cura ger\u00e6da brunbasu reaf 7 dyrwur\u00f0e reaf hiredes begymen.\nUtitur mulier anabola, sed abutitur ipsa bryc\u00f0 wif healsmene ac bi\u00f0 scamlice brocen heo.\nConuenit apozima nec non placenta inualidis gedauena\u00f0 bro\u00f0 eac swilce briw unhalum.\nO cleronoma, maneas Codrus dissertus unaque eala \u00feu cleric wuna \u00feu lareow gel\u00e6red \u00fe\u00e6t an.\nHau sis luxorius cum teneas yppos fisco ne sy \u00f0u to gal \u00feonne \u00feu healts hors on codde.\nCareas nomine limphatici, ut sis Crissostomus; adsis apocrisarus, seruet os aforismos tibi; constes,\nNe sis gimnus ab inlicitis, sisque biotticus autor Ne sy \u00f0u nacod fram unlyuendlicum 7 beo \u00f0u\nCelebres oroscopus acrizimum esque didascalus, habeasque amphiballum in thoro, et absit effebus;\nCareas fore cerritus atque perifrasticus \u00feola \u00feu wesan re\u00f0e 7 embspecende.\nNiteat abbachus manui atque niteat theologus ori scine wexbred on hande 7 scine godcund sp\u00e6c\nUideas ferre baccaulum fauste te cloace forewarna \u00feu beran b\u00e6re ges\u00e6liglice \u00fee pytte.\nHau sis prodigus, obliquus, monotalmus, subdolus ne sy \u00f0u tostencend gewed aneagede facenful.\nUites ludibrium, baratrum; sectare tropheum. forbuh \u00feu \u00fea bysmerlican helle fylig \u00feu sige.\nStent procul amphitetra tibi necnon egilopia; nam generant scrupulum, uexantque pupillas wunian\nNitet analogiam scandito obrissis ore docentis scine healsmene beorhte golde mu\u00f0e l\u00e6rendes.\nDeclina birotum brauium accipito cliothedrum forbuh \u00f0u twyhweolne sige onfoh \u00feu fyldestol.\nHabe culleum, scias diametra, nescias ergastula hafa \u00feu picen f\u00e6t wite \u00feu healfgemet nyte \u00feu\nApponas emistichium, cum sculpes distica foresete \u00f0u healf fers \u00f0\u00e6nne \u00feu writst twa fers.\nEnoforo; suesce laxare lotium on winf\u00e6te gewuna forl\u00e6tan mige\u00fean.\nDilige tu zenodochium, hodique zelotipia lufa \u00f0u \u00feearfana hus 7 hata \u00f0u hatunge.\nStringat hinc acitabula seu congia tuum doma gewri\u00f0e heonenne ecedf\u00e6t o\u00f0\u00f0e gemet \u00fein hus.\nSit pomerium curti, sunt pomaria congrua malis sy orcerdleh hirede synd orcerdas gedauenlice\nFulgeat ostrum eclesiis, sit oletum longe scine purpuren cyrcicum sy myx feor.\nStatuant predia quala tibi; agitent flabra flagra gesettan croftas wilian \u00f0e astyrian windas gyrda.\nPota diamoron, ut fugiat gorgon eminus drinc moro\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t forfleo n\u00e6ddre feor.\nSperne tu olon platon, quatinus lustret odon te sinposia forhige \u00f0u eall fenn \u00feanon onliht weg \u00fee\nUigeas temeson, si non potes insons; nec absitque lucar, quo flagret lar nectar tibi lufa \u00feu\nEsto memor tui gallonis beo \u00feu gemyndig \u00feines medgyldan.\nTimeto cieri ambro, neque sit tuus mulio strabo neque agason inermis ondr\u00e6d \u00feu beon geciged gifre\nSit frequens hyrudo comitata, quo fuerit abbaso, ac disparet intercapedo citatim ualidos sy gelomlic\nReminiscere tegat bule Christi mentem sibi tegat gausape mensam, si qua uirago penetret tuum\nComat entole te te regis baben proceresque gewlitega\u00f0 bebod \u00fee kyninges sweorbeah 7 ealdres.\nMinime superet abdomen corpus, mage teche nenig ne oferswi\u00f0 f\u00e6tnes lichaman ma bebod.\nHau sis neoteritus uranii atque neophitus, sed priscus ab olim iugiter dogmatis ac fidei, ut iter\nUiuas ancisus, quin moriare cardiacus lifa \u00feu ymsniden \u00feeh \u00fee ne swylte heortaancnysse.\nPosce colimbum, si gestas ceruleas uestes gewilna \u00feu w\u00e6schus gyf \u00feu bere horige reaf.\nDucitur limbus anquina, ducitur nec non arsippio anquina bi\u00f0 gel\u00e6d scip mid rape bi\u00f0 gel\u00e6d eac\nEquitatur canterius antelis postelisque bi\u00f0 geriden hengest mid forgyrdum 7 mid \u00e6fterr\u00e6pum.\nSed patiaris et antropiam, ut acam congerat tua mens eius apodix ateruam sibi; anquirunt talia\nSuffert agape nimis apta agapem for\u00feyldega\u00f0 lufe swy\u00fee gecweme \u00e6lfremede geswinc.\nSecteris acutis nisibus egidiam in giro fylig \u00feu mid scearpum hig\u00f0um gat on ymhwyrfte.\nTeneas agnatos, anheles quoque aregidiam uerbi, ne sis atratus in aslum hostis heald \u00feu \u00fea siblican\nNe angustent aulea sed alluat ethereus aprilax sceleris animam, ne fias apostata ne ne genyrwian\nGeras ancile leua, agoniam fidei dextra ber \u00feu scyld mid wynstran gewin geleafan mid swry\u00f0ran.\nAmaneas auspicio utan wuna \u00feu wiglunge.\nAmpliet altum apogeum aliguam annonam gem\u00e6nigfylde deop scr\u00e6f.\nTollas armenum, addas archisterium afyr \u00feu w\u00e6uels geeacna \u00feu mynster.\nColit architriclinus amicale amineum, atque honustat etiam autumnus apoforeta beg\u00e6\u00f0 beorscipes\nAst colat agamus antropus celibatum, et sic cernet argiripam patriam beatosque ciues 7 beg\u00e6\u00f0\nHaud est huic apoplexia cure, sed et astu nullos angustat, solet idem antiquare amartetes, aginat\nAlbent apoforeta huic alburnis pomis; comitantur illum amiciter cuncte uirtutes scina\u00f0 \u00e6ppelfata\nNon allidunt hunc sinistri affurcillando, et blatterat amineo si constiterint et referens eidem\nFateor probum buteonem, qui bidentat burra arua; sed retinet hic et ingenuus similem genituram ic\nEt apparat buggeus uerum biliosus atque apparat bosor taphium sibi, sed biliosum; componit sic\nO tu, herilis miles, moneas cunctos hoc comiter eala \u00feu drihtenlica cempa mynga \u00feu ealle \u00feysum\nCespitat preterea cum clandestinat quis culpam anthro atque communit clandestina in portu\nNam oluit illic clancule; non ualebit tamen constare ipsa diu clancula, tonante teste super per sacrata\nO tutor, clientele maneas hic immo uelut heres dei, cum uideas pessumdare nefandum astum per\nO tu clerice, poscas teneam quam pariter tecum eala \u00feu cleric bide \u00feu \u00fe\u00e6t ic healde \u00fe\u00e6t samod mid",
